[[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative (-) terminal.</p><p>1. Disconnect electrical connections (1a) and unscrew bolts (1b)\nsecuring the resistor to the fan.</p><p>2. Remove the resistor from its seat on the fan.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Engine fan adjustment resistor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890993\">O10</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034271.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Tighten the fan resistor bolts.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections.</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p>"]]